=1> Hey all, just wanted to let you know a great friend of mine is interested in joining Abyss, his name is Ctil Alive and he is a 51 Necro, he is fun, great to be with and i think he would make a good member of the guild.. I would like to sponser him and whatnot.. so please let me know what you think of him if you know him, and if you see him around, just say hello and get acquanted (sp?) with him. =)<br>
Also he would like to join us on some of our raids, so if there is room, and you guys all agree i would like to invite him, so he can get to know you all and you can get to know him.<br>
Thanks Guys =)<br>
 <p>-Venem Est`Poizon
54th Reaver of Abyss</p><i></i></td></tr><tr bgcolor=#E6E8fA><td nowrap width=20% valign=top align=left><span class=title> <A HREF=http://pub24.ezboard.com/uctilalive.showPublicProfile?language=EN>Ctil Alive</A></span><br> <span class=usertitle>Registered User</span><br>  Posts: 1<br> <font color=#1F2EA0>(5/3/01 12:11:50 am)</font><br>   <a href=http://pub24.ezboard.com/frellabyssfrm10.showAddReplyScreenFromWeb?topicID=146.topic&index=1>Reply</a>   </td><td valign=top align=left class=m><span class=title>   Re: Ctil - Interested in Joining Abyss</span><hr size=1> Hello everyone, as venem posted I am very interested in joining abyss. Now im a 52 necro and am a pretty good tinkerer if that matters. Abyss looks like a great guild as i see members around all the time. I mostly hang around kael or skyshrine and would love to group up with some of you soon. I look forward to being contacted in game soon,    thanks<br>
<br>
Ctil Alive 52 necro<br>
141 tinkerer <p></p><i></i></td></tr><tr bgcolor=#E6E8fA><td nowrap width=20% valign=top align=left><span class=title> <A HREF=http://pub24.ezboard.com/uctilalive.showPublicProfile?language=EN>Ctil Alive</A></span><br> <span class=usertitle>Registered User</span><br>  Posts: 2<br> <font color=#1F2EA0>(5/3/01 1:00:55 am)</font><br>   <a href=http://pub24.ezboard.com/frellabyssfrm10.showAddReplyScreenFromWeb?topicID=146.topic&index=2>Reply</a>   </td><td valign=top align=left class=m><span class=title>   Re: Ctil - Interested in Joining Abyss</span><hr size=1> heh forgot to mention abit about my playing hours, was in college so i played like 10 hours a day but now i gotta work for the summer so im not on as much but will be on prime playing time mosy days. being a necro ive mostly soloed here and there so not many people may know me from grouping with me.Ive been on very few raids so its a little disapointing, my weekend nights ussually ended in a bar heh. Was in Zu Nitche Machen (Do Nothing) guild since my 30s im sure. I was in the first ten formed from old &quot;Order of Guilded Tides&quot; members when it split way back when. Being an officer in a guild with 10 - 15 ppl max seemed kind of pointless and by the time i was in my 50s only 3 or 4 of us in the guild played regularly (could hardly group, let alone raid).<br>
 Been playing the game for over a year now and plan on playing many years to come as long as this server dont go to @#%$ =)   Any time you got room for a cute little gnome to pimp the cleric full of mana in a giant group or whatever give me a tell.<br>
<br>
Ctil Alive    52 heretic<br>
 <p></p><i></i></td></tr></table><table border=0 width=95%><tr><td align=left valign="top"> </td><td align=right valign="top"><a href="http://pub24.ezboard.com/frellabyssfrm10.showMessage?topicID=162.topic"> << Prev Topic</a>&nbsp;| <a href="http://pub24.ezboard.com/frellabyssfrm10.showMessage?topicID=159.topic"> Next Topic >> </a><br><br><a href=http://pub24.ezboard.com/frellabyssfrm10.showAddReplyScreenFromWeb?topicID=146.topic&index=2><img src=http://people.atl.mediaone.net/samugi/addreply.gif border=0 alt="Add Reply"></a> </td></tr></table><br><table width=95% border=0><td valign="top"> <a href=http://pub24.ezboard.com/frellabyssfrm10.emailToFriend?topicID=146.topic><img src=http://www.ezboard.com/image/email.gif border=0 alt="Email This To a Friend"> Email This To a Friend</a><br> <a href=http://pub24.ezboard.com/frellabyssfrm10.threadControl?topicID=146.topic><img src=http://www.ezboard.com/themes/sunset/deleteThread.gif border=0 alt="Topic Control Image"> Topic Commands (Moderator only)</a><br> <a href=http://pub24.ezboard.com/frellabyssfrm10.subscribeUnregisteredToTopic?topicID=146.topic>Subscribe</a> Click to receive email notification of replies<br>  <a href=http://pub24.ezboard.com/frellabyssfrm10.unsubscribeUnregisteredToTopic?topicID=146.topic>Unsubscribe</a> Click to stop receiving email notification of replies<br> </td><td align="right" valign="top"></td></tr><tr align="right"><td colspan=2><form action=http://pub24.ezboard.com/BBSForum.jumpShowForum method=post><table border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="1"><tr><td><b>jump to:</b><select name=forumName><option value="rellabyssfrm12">General Discussion<option value="rellabyssfrm10">New Members Sign-up<option value="rellabyssfrm8">General Discussion<option value="rellabyssfrm2">Upcoming Raids<option value="rellabyssfrm3">Lets do This<option value="rellabyssfrm4">Offerings and Christmas List<option value="rellabyssfrm5">New Member Sign Up & Discus